  "description": "Engaged signal path from Roland DS-1A December 1994 second-edition PSA service notes. Representative 1N4148 diodes stand in for 1S1588 or 1S2473 signal diodes; the input protection diode is represented by 1N4007. Bypass FETs remain in effect-on state. The op-amps use 1.5 V nominal headroom from both ends of the 9 V supply.",
  "io": {
    "groundNode": "0",
    "inputNode": "in",
    "outputNode": "out"
  },
